  "description": "Our top of the range alloy road bike takes the Vantage platform to the highest levels of performance. The 6061 hydroformed alloy frame with internal headset and cables paired to a carbon aero through axle fork makes for a lightweight package and ensures none of your effort is lost.\nFull 22 speed Shimano 105 hydraulic groupset provides flawless operation and unlocks some truly awesome capability. Seamless shifts and stopping on a dime isn’t an issue thanks to the STI shifters and 160mm rotors. Hydraulic brakes don’t just do power, they give plenty of modulation to give total control.\nTubeless ready Alex ATD470 tubeless ready rims wrapped in 28c Maxxis pursuer tyres give solid acceleration and confident road holding that urges you to push harder.\nThe Vantage 3.0 is the perfect riding to take you road cycling to the next step.",
